(7722239, 1270870, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ErinKirsten:</b></div><hr/><i> I appreciate the perspective I just think it is oversaturated </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree completely. I did try reducing the saturation but I then lost contrast - I''ve tried again since and find that if only I''d reduced ''vibrancy'' rather than ''saturation'', that would have done the trick.</td>', 'Originally posted by ErinKirsten: I appreciate the perspective I just think it is oversaturated   I agree completely. I did try reducing the saturation but I then lost contrast - I''ve tried again since and find that if only I''d reduced ''vibrancy'' rather than ''saturation'', that would have done the trick.', '2022-06-27 04:35:55.000000', NULL, 0),
